# .vercelignore — deployment target: @zotlit/docs (apps/docs)
#
# The upload keeps apps/docs plus its workspace dependency closure:
# packages/config (presets), packages/scripts (package-roots helpers),
# packages/db (template contract IR), and db's own deps packages/shared and
# packages/zotero-types. The `fumadocs-mdx` postinstall resolves
# @zotlit/db/contract/ir.json from db's committed src, so these packages must
# be present at install time. Sibling workspaces excluded below can be absent
# without breaking install — pnpm's frozen-lockfile install derives its
# project scope from pnpm-lock.yaml. Root manifests + turbo.json stay.

# --- Sibling apps (not in the docs dependency graph) ---
/apps/obsidian
/apps/zotero
/apps/website

# --- Packages the docs build never imports ---
/packages/item-lookup
/packages/obsidian-api
/packages/obsidian-i18n
/packages/pdfjs-dist
/packages/protocol
/packages/templates

# --- Repo-level content unrelated to the build ---
/docs
/.scratch
/scripts

# --- Caches & build artifacts (regenerated on Vercel) ---
node_modules
.git
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/.source
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
